# E-commerce Sales Performance & Customer Insights Dashboard Using Excel

## Project Overview

The E-commerce Sales Performance & Customer Insights Dashboard is a data analytics project developed using Microsoft Excel to analyze sales performance, customer purchasing patterns, product category performance, profitability, payment preferences, and product returns.

The project transforms sales transaction data into meaningful business insights through an interactive dashboard featuring Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), PivotCharts, and category slicers. It provides a consolidated view of business performance, helping users explore sales trends, compare regional results, and understand customer demographics.

## Project Objectives

- Analyze total sales, profit, quantity sold, and customer count.
- Monitor monthly sales trends and regional performance.
- Compare sales across different product categories.
- Evaluate payment method preferences and transaction amounts.
- Analyze product return patterns.
- Compare sales across customer age groups and genders.
- Enable interactive data exploration through Excel slicers.

